<title>POLAND: WBK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 12.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>WBK JAN NET RISES TO PLN 12.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.15 vs   11.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   19.53 vs   19.60</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 38.22 vs   35.50</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	75.55 vs   66.05</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Wielkopolski Bank</p>
<p>Kredytowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
